AMCHAM hosted an interaction with a U.S. House of Representatives Congressional delegation with Chairman Brian Mast of the House Foreign Affairs Committee, Representative Haley Stevens, Representative Shri Thanedar, Representative Jimmy Patronis, and Representative James Gallagher, and U.S. semiconductor companies operating in India. The discussion centered on deepening the U.S.-India strategic and economic partnership.  While the U.S. is home to the mature semiconductor and AI technology stack, India holds market scale and manufacturing and design capacity, hence the conversation explored how to translate this complementarity into action and two-way investment.

#AMCHAMIndia #USIndiaPartnership #StrategicPartnership

@BrianMastFL @J_Gallagher4CA @ShriThanedar
@JimmyPatronis @HaleyforMI @USAndIndia

